      "content": "Dear Counsel, we are writing to explore a prompt and efficient resolution to the Miller matter. While we maintain our position regarding the full scope of the contractual dispute, we are **willing** to discuss a pragmatic path forward to avoid protracted litigation. To that end, we propose a settlement of $\\$50,000$ as a basis for immediate resolution. We hope this offsets the desire for a swift and mutually acceptable conclusion.",
      "source": "target",
